ref10 (Daniel J. Bernstein, Niels Duif, Tanja Lange, Peter Schwabe,
Bo-Yin Yang et al. -- the SUPERCOP / NaCl "ref10" ed25519 implementation)

  Public domain.

  sello's field arithmetic (src/sello/field.nim), Edwards curve group
  operations and scalar multiplication (src/sello/scalar.nim), and the
  RFC 8032 encode/decode and scalar-reduction layer (src/sello/ed25519.nim,
  src/sello/scalar.nim) are direct ports of ref10's algorithms and, in
  several routines, its exact arithmetic structure. Individual functions
  carry a "ported from ref10 (public domain)" attribution in their doc
  comments at the point of use.

